#, no-wrap
msgid "003 — Roadmap"
msgstr "003 — Roadmap"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "We want Yii 3 to:"
msgstr "Queremos que o Yii 3:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "Not limit a developer to choosing architecture. Allow anything from \"classic\" MVC to DDD."
msgstr "Não limite o desenvolvedor na escolha da arquitetura. Permita qualquer coisa, do MVC \"clássico\" ao DDD."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "Be based on the best practices such as SOLID, GRASP, etc. and teach them to the community."
msgstr "Seja baseado em boas práticas como SOLID, GRASP etc. e as ensine à comunidade."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "Keep the most good things from Yii 2."
msgstr "Mantenha a maior parte das coisas boas do Yii 2."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "Be more open to the global PHP community and infrastructure."
msgstr "Seja mais aberto à comunidade e à infraestrutura PHP global."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "PSRs compliance"
msgstr "Conformidade com PSRs"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "PSR compliance helps with customizability, the ability to use general PHP libraries and implement fewer wrappers.  Here's the list of PSRs we want to implement."
msgstr "A conformidade com PSRs ajuda na personalização, permite usar bibliotecas PHP gerais e implementar menos wrappers.  Aqui está a lista de PSRs que queremos implementar."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "PSR-3 Logger"
msgstr "PSR-3 Logger"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "Implemented as a [separate package that isn't dependent on a framework](https://github.com/yiisoft/log)."
msgstr "Implementado como um [pacote separado que não depende de um framework](https://github.com/yiisoft/log)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "[x] Framework packages should depend on interface only."
msgstr "[x] Os pacotes do framework devem depender apenas da interface."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "[x] Split drivers into packages."
msgstr "[x] Separar os drivers em pacotes."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "[x] Clean-up code."
msgstr "[x] Limpar o código."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/003-roadmap.md
msgid "[x] [Fix email target](https://github.com/yiisoft/log-target-email)."
msgstr "[x] [Corrigir o destino de e-mail](https://github.com/yiisoft/log-target-email)."

